flowchart TB
  Q[Query text] --> E[Embed and prepare prefixes]
  E --> R[Route to selected clusters]
  R --> F[Apply the same eligibility filter]
  F --> A[A: scan selected rows]
  F --> B[B: traverse bitplanes]
  F --> C[C: enumerate lookup keys]
  A --> K[Keep binary candidates]
  B --> K
  C --> K
  K --> V[Optional longer-vector rerank]
  V --> O[Return top K documents]
